OL,3,GNEWSAWomen injured in detached caravan
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree women were injured and a man has
OL,7,Fbeen arrested after a caravan became
OL,8,Fdetached from a vehicle and mounted a
OL,9,Fpavement.
OL,11,FLancashire Police were called to
OL,12,FBeechtrees in Skelmersdale at about
OL,13,F20:30 BST on Wednesday to reports a
OL,14,Fcaravan had uncoupled from a dark blue
OL,15,FRange Rover Vogue and hit two
OL,16,F18-year-old women. A woman in her 30s
OL,17,Fwas then allegedly struck when the
OL,18,Fvehicle left the scene, the force said.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
