OL,3,GNEWSAWomen injured in detached caravan
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 44-year-old man from Rotherham was
OL,7,Farrested on suspicion of causing
OL,8,Fserious injury by dangerous driving and
OL,9,Fassault, and later released on bail
OL,10,Fpending further inquiries.
OL,12,FThe two teenagers were taken to
OL,13,Fhospital with serious injuries while
OL,14,Fthe third woman suffered minor
OL,15,Finjuries.
